title: CH1_M2_PHONE_CALL
---
// M2: cuoc goi shipper gia (hoi truong)
<<set_milestone 2>>
<<switch_ui "phone">>

Minh: "Alo?"
Shipper: "Em co don hang giao KTX. Can thanh toan truoc 118.000."
Shipper: "Em chuyen khoan roi anh se gui bao ve." 

-> Chuyen tien luon
    <<jump CH1_M2_TRANSFER>>
-> Hen lai hom khac
    <<jump CH1_M2_DELAY>>
-> Nhan tin hoi phong 308
    <<jump CH1_M2_ASK_ROOM>>
===

title: CH1_M2_ASK_ROOM
---
<<trace TRACE_ASK_PERSON 1>>
Minh: "De tui nhan tin hoi phong da..."
Minh: "Khong ai tra loi kip."
Shipper: "Em chuyen nhanh giup anh nhe, con nhieu don lam."

-> Chuyen tien
    <<jump CH1_M2_TRANSFER>>
-> Hen lai
    <<jump CH1_M2_DELAY>>
===

title: CH1_M2_TRANSFER
---
<<trace TRACE_TRANSFER_MONEY 2>>
<<trace TRACE_ACT_UNDER_PRESSURE 3>>
Minh: "Roi, em chuyen roi."

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<set_objective "OBJ_M2_CHECK_APP">>
===

title: CH1_M2_DELAY
---
<<trace TRACE_DELAY_ACTION 4>>
Minh: "Em dang o hoi truong, khong ra duoc. De em hen lai." 

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<set_objective "OBJ_M2_CHECK_APP">>
===

title: CH1_M2_CHECK_APP
---
